70-a361-11f0-b814-0f72f73fa4cf/file-jaoe38c1mggddutk.png?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1mggddutj/6185b1ec-ad19-4807-bfe2-4f088c9cc2b3/c00eb570-a361-11f0-b814-0f72f73fa4cf/file-jaoe38c1mggddutk.png?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>Statement 1 is True</p>\n<p>Statement 2 is True, it follows the energy conservatioin.</p>\n<p>But statement 2 is not correct explanation of statement 1.</p>"}},"subject":"physics","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":200000,"topic":"photoelectric-effect","type":"mcq","year":2007,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"yearKey":"iit-jee-2007-paper-1-offline","active":true}],"ids":["1lg1y9sug","1lg1yg62t"],"title":"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 1 Offline | JEE Advanced Year Wise Previous Years Questions","canonical":"https://app/past-years/jee/pstatement-1p-pthe-formula-connecting-u-v-and-f-for-jee-advanced-physics-motion-iofksetrmqxbxguf"}